  <clipboard-copy role="menuitem" data-dd-action-name="comment.copy_markdown" value="In this case we should remove `WebGLDeferredRenderer` since it is based on are workflow which is not supported anymore. It seems not possible to fix `WebGLDeferredRenderer` without changing other entities like `RenderPass`. The class only works if the post-processing respects `autoClearDepth` and `autoClearStencil` . And that&#39;s not true anymore since passes clear all buffers.

